  "summary": "Reviewed the complete GPT All Saints expansive study and its 22-page PDF against the research records and exact cited evidence: the consequential-difficulty tests at sections/30-communion-of-saints.tex:3\u201344 against Bede on Apocalypse 7:4,9 (Marshall pp.46,52), and sections/40-purification-and-rest.tex:3\u201337 against Chrysostom Matthew XXXVIII.3\u20135, pass for source fidelity and intelligible reasoning; Augustine's Sermon on the Mount I.1.3\u2013I.4.12, Psalms 32/33/87, City of God XX.9, Gregory XII.5.6\u20137, Aquinas Psalm 33 nn.10\u201311, and the pertinent Schuster pages were also checked. Complete appointed-text mode, fourteen-text inventory, historical-English distinctions and the historical chronology presentation agree with the recorded scope, but CHANGES_REQUIRED because the second interpretation omits the Lesson; this review makes no new original-language collation, independent rights adjudication, global chronology acceptance, or final visual/web acceptance claim."
